#
# Consumer .npmrc template — copy to your app's root as `.npmrc`.
#
# Two lines: (1) route the @fundacja-peryskop scope to GitHub Packages,
# (2) attach a GitHub Personal Access Token for authentication. The token
# is read from the environment so it never ends up committed.
#
# To set up:
#   1. Create a PAT at https://github.com/settings/tokens (classic) with
#      the `read:packages` scope. Save it as an env var, e.g. in ~/.zshrc:
#        export GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
#   2. Copy this file to your app's `.npmrc` (do NOT commit that file if
#      it contains a literal token — the ${GITHUB_TOKEN} form below is
#      safe to commit because npm expands it at install time).
#   3. Run `npm install @fundacja-peryskop/ui`.
#
# CI: set GITHUB_TOKEN as a repository secret and export it before install.
#

@fundacja-peryskop:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
